tery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1470130,\"title\":\"The Mortuary Assistant\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/72AoFPC5TY4DfJwXXS9rPwPeReD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gM1kQRPwOVW1Eos5tVWqcYmHR5S.jpg\",\"rating\":5.3,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Rebecca Owens, a recent mortuary science graduate takes a night shift job at River Fields Mortuary. Initially, the job seems straightforward — embalming bodies, completing paperwork, and keeping things tidy. But once Rebecca starts working the night shift, things take a dark turn.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":680493,\"title\":\"Return to Silent Hill\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4xf7KoifUAjMbhSRcjuZv4Eu0FQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v0NEB75SZjxY8GS3ho8WeEvjIT3.jpg\",\"rating\":5.3,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When James receives a mysterious letter from his lost love Mary, he is drawn to Silent Hill—a once-familiar town now consumed by darkness. As he searches for her, James faces monstrous creatures and unravels a terrifying truth that will push him to the edge of his sanity.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1408208,\"title\":\"Exit 8\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nQXYTvm6AY4WmtcPskroqC7Skh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f5csnjqQj5qdqc0EZchon94hXZ6.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A man trapped in an endless sterile subway passageway sets out to find Exit 8. The rules of his quest are simple: do not overlook anything out of the ordinary. If you discover an anomaly, turn back immediately. If you don’t, carry on. Then leave from Exit 8. But even a single oversight will send him back to the beginning. Will he ever reach his goal and escape this infinite corridor?\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"-8d987Wtkxs\"